Error [E0989]: This `comptime if` condition can't be known at compile time
  --> tests/ui/comptime_if_noncomptime_cond.jet:3:17
    |
  3 |     comptime if x {
    |                 ^
 Why: A `comptime if` condition must be a known-time expression — a prepared value, a literal, or a pure function call with known arguments
 Fix: Prepare the value first: `flag :: comptime { … }`, then write `comptime if flag { … }`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0989
